#heading(level: 3)[#text("What a coin buys")]
#text("A simple meal costs 1 coin. A plain bed costs 2 coins per night, meals separate.") #text("Ordinary local labor pays about 3 coins per day; skilled work about 6. These are") #text("anchors, not a requirement to simulate wages. Dangerous adventuring earns more") #text("because it risks wounds, scarce Grit and death, not because food becomes expensive") #text("when a character gains levels.")

#text("Equipment grants still happen first. Coins buy objects and supplies, never DP,") #text("discipline ranks, signature access or training. Owning armor does not grant its") #text("training card. A purchased weapon’s appearance supplies no damage modifier.") #text("Prices for functionally equivalent ordinary melee weapons are equal; a jeweled") #text("hilt may be valuable decoration but does not hit harder.")

