#heading(level: 3)[#text("Supplies and restocking")]
#text("The printed price buys one full supply at its listed die, including an ordinary") #text("holder. All three healing bottles currently use d4; their potency, not supply die,") #text("differs. This pass preserves those existing values rather than quietly increasing") #text("potion longevity. A die checks after use and on 1 steps down; the last use works.")

#text("A d4 averages 4 uses before empty; d6 averages 10 total uses through its d4 stage;") #text("d8 averages 18. These are expectations, not guaranteed charges. The inventory die") #text("cannot be converted into an exact number of arrows or spoonfuls.")

#text("")#strong[#text("Shop refills:")]#text(" a shop can refill a supply to its printed starting die") #text("for its full listed supply price. Or buy a separate full supply at that price,") #text("which costs another Bulk. No discounted partial refill, die combining, decanting") #text("into fresh full-die bottles or cash credit for unknown leftovers. This keeps the") #text("market simple without changing crafting’s existing step-increase procedure.") #text("Fresh safe water can refill its flask freely; a town refill costs 1 coin if charged.")

