#chapter("11","Summoned Companions")
#metadata("s-e8df3b6d78cc")<s-e8df3b6d78cc>
#twocol[
#text("You call across a boundary, and something answers: paws on stone, a flicker of") #text("ancestral light, a shape unfolding from cold air. The creature acts through your") #text("attention. Its presence gives you choices, not a second independent turn.")

#text("Choose from the profiles in this chapter when a summoning ability permits the") #text("category and tier. Higher-tier cards can choose eligible lower-tier creatures.") #text("Category names alone do not grant access to an unlisted creature.")

#heading(level: 3)[#text("Command the creature")]
#text("Spend your ")#strong[#text("Main Action")]#text(" to give one summon a Main Action and a Maneuver. Spend") #text("your ")#strong[#text("Maneuver")]#text(" to give one summon a Maneuver and movement. Normal conversions") #text("apply. The Main-command package has no separate movement allowance: convert its") #text("Maneuver to movement if it needs to approach before attacking.")

#text("A summon receives at most one command on your turn. You can spend your Main Action") #text("on one creature and your Maneuver on another. A summoning card's immediate free") #text("Main command counts as that creature's command for the turn.")

#text("An uncommanded summon does ")#strong[#text("nothing")]#text(". It does not follow, keep watch, alert you,") #text("continue a previous task, or take Reactions and opportunity attacks. Existing") #text("conditions, durations and passive defenses still operate. Resolve its turn-based") #text("timing on your turn. You cannot summon creatures that summon more creatures.")

#heading(level: 3)[#text("Keep the connection")]
#text("A summon disappears beyond ")#strong[#text("6 squares")]#text(" from you, including after forced movement") #text("of either participant. It also disappears at 0 HP, or when you become unconscious") #text("or die. Its duration may end earlier. It leaves no permanent equipment or loot.")

#text("For a large footprint, agree the tether measurement with the DA before placement;") #text("the general rules do not yet define every multi-square case. Do not quietly gain") #text("extra reach by moving only one corner of a creature inside the boundary.")

#heading(level: 3)[#text("Give a useful order")]
#text("“Attack that creature,” “defend this spot,” “move into cover,” and “help them cross”") #text("are clear intentions. The creature still needs the printed capability and enough") #text("commanded actions to carry them out. A previous order never buys activity next turn.") #text("Outside combat, you must continue directing a longer task for its full time.")

#text("Roll the creature's attack attribute, not your own, and read its player-facing") #text("attacker outcomes. When it is attacked, roll the defense attribute named by the") #text("incoming attack using the creature's value. Apply the profile's attack or defense") #text("Boons/Banes and resistance normally. There is never a second opposed roll.")

#text("The profiles below include only the summoned form's permitted capabilities. A") #text("monster's dramatic description does not grant its summoned form extra actions,") #text("active auras, independent attacks or skills.")

]
